<title>GREECE: U.S. EMBASSY CLOSED ON THANKSGIVING DAY, NOV 28.</title>
<headline>U.S. EMBASSY CLOSED ON THANKSGIVING DAY, NOV 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. embassy in Athens, the U.S. consulates general in Athens and Thessaloniki and all U.S. government offices in Greece including the American library will be closed on Thursday in observance of the Thanksgiving Day, the embassy said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
